AC   PRU01334;
DC   Domain;
TR   PROSITE; PS51990; COV_NSP2_M; 1; level=0
XX
Names: Coronavirus (CoV) Nsp2 middle domain
Function: Nsp2 has been implicated in processes ranging from translation
 repression to endosomal transport, ribosome biogenesis, and actin filament
 binding. Nsp2 in SARS-CoV-2 and other coronaviruses have been observed to
 localize to endosomes and replication-transcription complexes (RTC). Nsp2 may
 be involved in binding nucleic acids and regulating intracellular signaling
 pathways. It contains an N-terminal, a middle and a C-terminal domain.
XX
CC   -!- SIMILARITY: Belongs to the coronaviruses polyprotein 1ab family.
XX
FT   From: PS51990
FT   DOMAIN          from..to
FT                   /note="CoV Nsp2 middle #"
